ichtbaar worden. Ook legt hij uit hoe de ouderdom van materiaal kan worden bepaald. De voorbeelden komen uit uiteenlopende wetenschappelijke vakgebieden en worden verbonden met zijn kritiek op creationistische verklaringen. Het doel is niet alleen Darwins gedachtegang te beschrijven, maar te laten zien op welke onderzoeksresultaten de moderne evolutionaire verklaring steunt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL1966487W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p320421872"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:34:00.000Z","reference":"work:2409","note":"Dawkins science non-fiction TheGreatestShowonEarth2009; exact NieuwAmsterdam paperback. No automatic taste traits or claims of measured popularity.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-022.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL1966487W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p320421872"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":6832257,"sha256":"1b64d82da3e00bb1c4a3c79e0605c464cb4b8ac584ea5008f77adce8ee2edcbd","reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-003.jpg. Richard Dawkins; Het grootste spektakel ter wereld; Bewijs voor evolutie; Nieuw Amsterdam. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:34:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-010"}},{"ref":"m2","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":987209003},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":987209003,"work_id":987109002,"bound_author_id":987309001,"bound_title":"Het grootste spektakel ter wereld","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":