 zo''n cultuur onveranderd zou moeten blijven. Het vertellen zelf wordt een manier om te onderzoeken hoe verbondenheid en verandering met elkaar kunnen samengaan.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL857555W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p051592827"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:34:00.000Z","reference":"work:5055","note":"VargasLlosa Elhablador1987. One Dutch paperback and original source identity, retain Work5055.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-028.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL857555W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p051592827"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":12552996,"sha256":"900708ea4b57ddc3468d07921d9b22da2020627afcae0e6d5bc88e3eb0412bb3","reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:34:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-010"}},{"ref":"m3","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":987209009},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":987209009,"work_id":987109007,"bound_author_id":987304007,"bound_title":"Het woord van de verteller","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789029039116","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/12552996-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/12552996-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p051592827","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p051592827"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:34:00.000Z","reference":"work:5055","note":"VargasLlosa Elhablador1987. One Dutch paperback and original source identity, retain Work5055.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-028.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL857555W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p051592827"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":12552996,"sha256":"900708ea4b57ddc3468d07921d9b22da2020627afcae0e6d5bc88e3eb0412bb3","reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:34:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-010"}},{"ref":"d4","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987109006,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987109006,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":987309003,"text":"In 2120 ligt Londen in puin. Prins Alfred kent alleen het leven binnen Buckingham Palace, maar ook daar dringt het gevaar binnen. ''s Nachts gebeuren er vreemde dingen in de gangen en de wereld buiten het paleis blijkt vol monsters en geheimen. Wanneer zijn moeder, de koningin, naar de Tower wordt weggevoerd, moet Alfred zijn beschutte bestaan verlaten. David Walliams laat de jonge prins zoeken naar de moed om te handelen in een stad waarvan hij de werkelijkheid nauwelijks heeft leren kennen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL20659782W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p435573187"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:34:00.000Z","reference":"work:3535","note":"Walliams children’s novel, Clavis hardcover. Current content summary does not claim source2020citation as first original year.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-029.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL20659782W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p4355731